<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυᾱγ-έω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυηγ-</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεναυάγηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.236
				</span></i>
			 (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηγ</span>-), <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				76
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς,
				ἄγνυμι</span>):—<i>suffer shipwreck</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				34.10
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., of chariots, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				61.29
			</span></i>; of an earthen vessel, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				180
			</span></i>; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἐν τοῖς ἰδίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				5.55
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.33
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ βίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ceb.
					24.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὴν πίστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Ti.</u>
					1.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χὡ μὲν ἐναυάγει γαίης ἔπι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.208
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυαγεῖ συμπόσια μὴ τυχόντα παιδαγωγίας
					ὀρθῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.622b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
